      "description": "UP/1B Calculator is a step-by-step guide and calculation tool for Gas Safe registered engineers carrying out installation pipework tightness testing to IGEM/UP/1B Edition 4.\n\nThe app guides you through every stage of the tightness test procedure:\n• Installation Volume Test (IVt) — calculates the correct test pressure and acceptable pressure drop for the installation size\n• Let-By Test — checks for meter regulator let-by\n• Tightness Test — records pressure readings and determines pass or fail\n• LDF Check — guides leak detection fluid testing of all disturbed joints\n• Purge — calculates purge volume for safe gas release\n• PDF Record — generates a professional gas tightness test record ready to save or share\nDesigned specifically for natural gas, LPG and LPG/Air in accordance with IGEM/UP/1B Edition 4.\nAll test records are saved to your account and sync across devices.\nFor use by Gas Safe registered engineers only.",
